OL,3,AHundreds complain about I'm A Celebrity
OL,4,Aafter Mariella Frostrup called AJ Odudu
OL,5,A'aggressive'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 800 people have complained to
OL,8,Fthe media regulator about an episode of
OL,9,FITV reality show I'm A Celebrity... Get
OL,10,FMe Out of Here! in which Mariella
OL,11,FFrostrup accused her campmate AJ Odudu
OL,12,Fof being "aggressive".
OL,14,FOfcom said 887 people had filed
OL,15,Fcomplaints about Sunday's episode in
OL,16,Frelation to "alleged bullying
OL,17,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.
OL,19,FAn Ofcom spokesperson told BBC News:
OL,20,F"We are assessing the complaints
OL,21,Fagainst our rules, but are yet to
OL,22,Fdecide whether or not to investigate."
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
